(7521730, 1202086, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the diagonal composition.</td>', 'Love the diagonal composition.', '2017-07-06 13:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521731, 1201793, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks quite chaotic.</td>', 'Looks quite chaotic.', '2017-07-06 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521733, 1202059, 65234, '<td valign="top">Such lush greenery.</td>', 'Such lush greenery.', '2017-07-06 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521734, 1201960, 65234, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a tea plantation before. Many, many shades of green here.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a tea plantation before. Many, many shades of green here.', '2017-07-06 13:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521735, 1202046, 65234, '<td valign="top">I can hear the call in my head.</td>', 'I can hear the call in my head.', '2017-07-06 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521736, 1201975, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very painterly; suits the flowers.</td>', 'Very painterly; suits the flowers.', '2017-07-06 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521737, 1202084, 65234, '<td valign="top">The vastness of ... a leaf :-) Nicely composed and I like your DOF.</td>', 'The vastness of ... a leaf :-) Nicely composed and I like your DOF.', '2017-07-06 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521738, 1201780, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely to see from above. On my screen, the midtones and darks look too dark to me.</td>', 'Lovely to see from above. On my screen, the midtones and darks look too dark to me.', '2017-07-06 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521739, 1202094, 65234, '<td valign="top">Phlox? Interesting to see a few buds left in the middle after the other flowers have not only opened, but some look old already. Love the color; not entirely sure I like the composition, but I tend not to like centered subjects as much. Maybe crop it tighter and put the buds on a rule of thirds intersection? Right now the buds are just overwhelmed by the flowers to my eye, and I want to see them better.</td>', 'Phlox? Interesting to see a few buds left in the middle after the other flowers have not only opened, but some look old already. Love the color; not entirely sure I like the composition, but I tend not to like centered subjects as much. Maybe crop it tighter and put the buds on a rule of thirds intersection? Right now the buds are just overwhelmed by the flowers to my eye, and I want to see them better.', '2017-07-06 13:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521753, 1201536, 30364, '<td valign="top">Green &amp; gold?  Really?  Well, good on ya, mate.  Thank you.</td>', 'Green & gold?  Really?  Well, good on ya, mate.  Thank you.', '2017-07-06 15:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521756, 1201655, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the best of show, and there was some very decent competition too.  <br/>If this wasn''t set up, it''s brilliant.  If it was, then it''s not what I wanted it to be and I expect you to lie to me, please.  <br/>So I''m working now on the assumption that either it really <i>was</i> spontaneous or that you''ll be a really good liar: 10. Thank you.</td>', 'This is the best of show, and there was some very decent competition too.  If this wasn''t set up, it''s brilliant.  If it was, then it''s not what I wanted it to be and I expect you to lie to me, please.  So I''m working now on the assumption that either it really was spontaneous or that you''ll be a really good liar: 10. Thank you.', '2017-07-06 16:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521878, 1202061, 114285, '<td valign="top">Good documentation!</td>', 'Good documentation!', '2017-07-07 05:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521879, 1201807, 114285, '<td valign="top">Caught me off track! Stunning is what came to mind. The light, high contrast and wonderful mood and that one person added is always intriguing. A shot you should be proud of. An instant fave and a 10~</td>', 'Caught me off track! Stunning is what came to mind. The light, high contrast and wonderful mood and that one person added is always intriguing. A shot you should be proud of. An instant fave and a 10~', '2017-07-07 05:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521880, 1202008, 114285, '<td valign="top">Brilliant catch! Your timing is impeccable!</td>', 'Brilliant catch! Your timing is impeccable!', '2017-07-07 05:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521884, 1202024, 156466, '<td valign="top">Half a step to the left - that chandelier needs to be dead center. It also looks like there''s some strange perspective warping with the top and left leaning right.</td>', 'Half a step to the left - that chandelier needs to be dead center. It also looks like there''s some strange perspective warping with the top and left leaning right.', '2017-07-07 06:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521885, 1201711, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is much more effective in full res but alas it''s lost in the squashed verticals of the voting presentation. Can''t give it what it likely deserves and won''t give it what it likely doesn''t so no vote.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is much more effective in full res but alas it''s lost in the squashed verticals of the voting presentation. Can''t give it what it likely deserves and won''t give it what it likely doesn''t so no vote.', '2017-07-07 06:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521886, 1201567, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to have you do some dodging and burning to bring the bird out in the window while subduing the reflections a bit. Neat capture but it needs a bit of work in post to make the live bird stand shoulder to shoulder with the hummers.</td>', 'Would have loved to have you do some dodging and burning to bring the bird out in the window while subduing the reflections a bit. Neat capture but it needs a bit of work in post to make the live bird stand shoulder to shoulder with the hummers.', '2017-07-07 06:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521887, 1201973, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is really well lit and processed, but where it fails is at capture time. These shots are plentiful and the difference between the ones that work and the ones that don''t usually depend on camera position. Step left and shoot straight down the middle - this needs even angles on the sides, and straight and parallel boards running up to the subject. Alas, it may have messed with the light behind him, but if your leading lines aren''t there then the rest is wasted, lovely as it is. Giving it a 6 but it could have been much higher.</td>', 'This is really well lit and processed, but where it fails is at capture time. These shots are plentiful and the difference between the ones that work and the ones that don''t usually depend on camera position. Step left and shoot straight down the middle - this needs even angles on the sides, and straight and parallel boards running up to the subject. Alas, it may have messed with the light behind him, but if your leading lines aren''t there then the rest is wasted, lovely as it is. Giving it a 6 but it could have been much higher.', '2017-07-07 06:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521888, 1201565, 156466, '<td valign="top">I want to love this but it''s a little too high contrast - or at least a little/lot too hot on the whites. Neat effect and well seen, but the blown out center makes me squint.</td>', 'I want to love this but it''s a little too high contrast - or at least a little/lot too hot on the whites. Neat effect and well seen, but the blown out center makes me squint.', '2017-07-07 06:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521889, 1202008, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great detail with the wren, which I know from experience can be rather difficult - their feathers almost always moire for me. Lovely capture.</td>', 'Great detail with the wren, which I know from experience can be rather difficult - their feathers almost always moire for me. Lovely capture.', '2017-07-07 06:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521890, 1202045, 156466, '<td valign="top">There''s so much here that the lightning strike is practically lost - and that''s what sets this apart. Wondering what you could have done to emphasize that in post? It''s a well captured cityscape that dwarfs the one thing that makes it unique.</td>', 'There''s so much here that the lightning strike is practically lost - and that''s what sets this apart. Wondering what you could have done to emphasize that in post? It''s a well captured cityscape that dwarfs the one thing that makes it unique.', '2017-07-07 06:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521891, 1201646, 156466, '<td valign="top">You got everything right on this except the framing/perspective. Needs to be shot perfectly straight down the middle so your run-up has perfect symmetry. You were close enough that it could have been fixed in post. Really nice, and I''m sort of glad you didn''t use a long exposure here, though I''m wondering how this would look at 5-10 seconds? Really like it otherwise. Ping me if you''re fuzzy on doing the correction.</td>', 'You got everything right on this except the framing/perspective. Needs to be shot perfectly straight down the middle so your run-up has perfect symmetry. You were close enough that it could have been fixed in post. Really nice, and I''m sort of glad you didn''t use a long exposure here, though I''m wondering how this would look at 5-10 seconds? Really like it otherwise. Ping me if you''re fuzzy on doing the correction.', '2017-07-07 07:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521892, 1201816, 156466, '<td valign="top">You need the lightning strike that got lost on the other photo taken this night.</td>', 'You need the lightning strike that got lost on the other photo taken this night.', '2017-07-07 07:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521893, 1201654, 156466, '<td valign="top">What a capture. But I just can''t get away from the sharpening halo on the bird - it keeps pulling my eye there.</td>', 'What a capture. But I just can''t get away from the sharpening halo on the bird - it keeps pulling my eye there.', '2017-07-07 07:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521894, 1201793, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2017-07-07 07:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521895, 1201822, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well seen. Would prefer if you were about 1/2 meter left and shooting square at the phones.</td>', 'Well seen. Would prefer if you were about 1/2 meter left and shooting square at the phones.', '2017-07-07 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521896, 1201991, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well framed and captured, but the high contrast treatment wipes out all the subtle details in here, and there are SO many of them. Sometimes less is more.</td>', 'Well framed and captured, but the high contrast treatment wipes out all the subtle details in here, and there are SO many of them. Sometimes less is more.', '2017-07-07 07:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
