(7522010, 1202088, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love seeing the faces in the water, and not seeing them, but knowing they''re there.<br/> <br/>This is not easy. You have to keep looking at it. You have to get mad at it, return to it, and you should probably write a letter or two.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love seeing the faces in the water, and not seeing them, but knowing they''re there. This is not easy. You have to keep looking at it. You have to get mad at it, return to it, and you should probably write a letter or two. I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2017-07-08 00:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
