(7522080, 1201655, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> This is the best of show, and there was some very decent competition too.  <br/>If this wasn''t set up, it''s brilliant.  If it was, then it''s not what I wanted it to be and I expect you to lie to me, please.  <br/>So I''m working now on the assumption that either it really <i>was</i> spontaneous or that you''ll be a really good liar: 10. Thank you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you for the kind words, and yes, it is unstaged, I lie you not.</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: This is the best of show, and there was some very decent competition too.  If this wasn''t set up, it''s brilliant.  If it was, then it''s not what I wanted it to be and I expect you to lie to me, please.  So I''m working now on the assumption that either it really was spontaneous or that you''ll be a really good liar: 10. Thank you.  Thank you for the kind words, and yes, it is unstaged, I lie you not.', '2017-07-08 10:26:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7522082, 1201276, 14476, '<td valign="top">Having also tried to get humpbacks in mid-leap here on the Pacific, I know exactly how difficult this shot was, and how beautifully it was executed.  <br/> <br/>Congratulations on the shot of a lifetime.<br/> <br/>because I couldn''t resist, here''s mine, from 2005.  The thrill was the same, the score was (er) different.  :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=227918" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/375/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_227918.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/375/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_227918.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/375/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_227918.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Having also tried to get humpbacks in mid-leap here on the Pacific, I know exactly how difficult this shot was, and how beautifully it was executed.   Congratulations on the shot of a lifetime. because I couldn''t resist, here''s mine, from 2005.  The thrill was the same, the score was (er) different.  :)', '2017-07-08 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
