(7523038, 1202049, 3548, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, extremely well-executed.<br/>To take it to the next level -- and to my eye and IMHO -- requires only a slightly tighter cropping (off the top particularly)  and a slight (minimal) leveling of the table (I didn''t say level).<br/>Doing so would draw the viewer into the image and make for a more intimate experience. Again, an exceptional image!</td>', 'A beautiful image, extremely well-executed.To take it to the next level -- and to my eye and IMHO -- requires only a slightly tighter cropping (off the top particularly)  and a slight (minimal) leveling of the table (I didn''t say level).Doing so would draw the viewer into the image and make for a more intimate experience. Again, an exceptional image!', '2017-07-12 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7523046, 1202049, 181331, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by davidspyle:</b></div><hr/><i> A beautiful image, extremely well-executed.<br/>To take it to the next level -- and to my eye and IMHO -- requires only a slightly tighter cropping (off the top particularly)  and a slight (minimal) leveling of the table (I didn''t say level).<br/>Doing so would draw the viewer into the image and make for a more intimate experience. Again, an exceptional image! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks a lot for your feedback.... Will keep them in mind.</td>', 'Originally posted by davidspyle: A beautiful image, extremely well-executed.To take it to the next level -- and to my eye and IMHO -- requires only a slightly tighter cropping (off the top particularly)  and a slight (minimal) leveling of the table (I didn''t say level).Doing so would draw the viewer into the image and make for a more intimate experience. Again, an exceptional image!  Thanks a lot for your feedback.... Will keep them in mind.', '2017-07-12 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
